    "name": "Conradito Caf\u00e9zito",
    "steam_appid": 3235270,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>Conradito Caf\u00e9zito</strong>, an <strong>incremental</strong> and <strong>idle</strong> game with a <u>coffee</u> theme where every click counts! Manage your caf\u00e9 in a colorful 2D pixelated environment, raking in <strong>money</strong> through automatic coffee production and optimizing every step of your business. Automate tasks, hire employees, improve recipes, and open new branches to speed up your <strong>growth</strong> and maximize profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With click mechanics, minigames, and the ability to expand your barista empire, Conradito Caf\u00e9zito blends casual time-management strategy with fun economic depth. Perfect for those who love seeing numbers rise as they upgrade their caf\u00e9 with every new investment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235270/extras/86b720eba216aa1058d5411465389536.avif?t=1734648231\" data-has-big width=800 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world of coffee beans, you can unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>36 authentic recipes from the real world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different ingredients</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, it might even inspire new creations in the real world?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235270/extras/b51d4f6c104aed1db71fedff2fb4fb53.avif?t=1734648231\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you can speed up your growth and production process with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 improvements and machinery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separated into 7 real-world production concepts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything to speed up your production process and turn your coffee shop into a real money-making machine.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235270/extras/1508580e1127a38cdf16464eac62a93f.avif?t=1734648231\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you won't just enjoy &quot;idling&quot; while the money rolls in, unlike standard idle game experiences, as you have</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 expansions that modify the gameplay and boost your growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 dynamic minigames that provide bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebirth</strong> factor of the game with the &quot;New Roast&quot; mode that allows you to restart the game with exclusive bonuses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, grab your &quot;caf\u00e9zito&quot;, because it's time to make the magic happen at Conradito Caf\u00e9zito!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235270/extras/85fcc9c4dc7214f860728f9bdaccf749.avif?t=1734648231\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the world of <strong>Conradito Caf\u00e9zito</strong>, an <strong>incremental</strong> and <strong>idle</strong> game with a <u>coffee</u> theme where every click counts! Manage your caf\u00e9 in a colorful 2D pixelated environment, raking in <strong>money</strong> through automatic coffee production and optimizing every step of your business. Automate tasks, hire employees, improve recipes, and open new branches to speed up your <strong>growth</strong> and maximize profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With click mechanics, minigames, and the ability to expand your barista empire, Conradito Caf\u00e9zito blends casual time-management strategy with fun economic depth. Perfect for those who love seeing numbers rise as they upgrade their caf\u00e9 with every new investment!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235270/extras/86b720eba216aa1058d5411465389536.avif?t=1734648231\" data-has-big width=800 height=199 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world of coffee beans, you can unlock:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>36 authentic recipes from the real world</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8 different ingredients</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who knows, it might even inspire new creations in the real world?   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235270/extras/b51d4f6c104aed1db71fedff2fb4fb53.avif?t=1734648231\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you can speed up your growth and production process with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >35 improvements and machinery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Separated into 7 real-world production concepts</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything to speed up your production process and turn your coffee shop into a real money-making machine.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235270/extras/1508580e1127a38cdf16464eac62a93f.avif?t=1734648231\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And you won't just enjoy &quot;idling&quot; while the money rolls in, unlike standard idle game experiences, as you have</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 expansions that modify the gameplay and boost your growth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7 dynamic minigames that provide bonuses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebirth</strong> factor of the game with the &quot;New Roast&quot; mode that allows you to restart the game with exclusive bonuses</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, grab your &quot;caf\u00e9zito&quot;, because it's time to make the magic happen at Conradito Caf\u00e9zito!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3235270/extras/85fcc9c4dc7214f860728f9bdaccf749.avif?t=1734648231\" width=800 height=374 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "It costs the price of a coffee \u2013 but it lasts much longer! Conradito Caf\u00e9zito, is an idle and incremental game where you unlock recipes, automate processes, and expand your coffee empire while watching your profits rise with every click!",
